            "review_title": "Review at Hoi An Coffee House",
            "review_text": "Stan\nBeeston, United Kingdom3 contributions\n0\nBeautiful food and friendly staff\nMay 2019 • Couples\nWe stayed here for 6 nights (they have rooms upstairs that are available to rent on Airbnb). Our stay was really comfortable and included breakfast and a drink each morning. The food was so good, and so cheap! I had the grilled pork with rice noodle salad a few times, as it was absolutely delicious (and only cost 25,000!). The staff are all really friendly and attentive, without lingering or hurrying you along. Would definitely recommend! The coffees and cold fruit drinks and also super tasty.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 13, 2019",
